{
  "description": "This protocol performs Amplify Tagmented Amplicons for the Illumina COVIDSeq protocol.\nLinks:\n 1. Anneal RNA\n 2. Synthesize First Strand cDNA\n 3. Amplify cDNA\n 4. Tagment PCR Amplicons\n 5. Post Tagmentation Clean Up\n 6. Amplify Tagmented Amplicons",
  "tags": [
    "NGS Library Prep",
    "Illumina COVIDSeq"
  ],
  "labware": [
